  "updated_at": "2026-03-25",
  "bio": "Mauro Franco is a skilled tattoo artist based in Alejandro Korn, Argentina, renowned for his adeptness in dotwork. Since beginning his career in 2014, Mauro has honed his craft to specialize in an array of styles including realism, portraits, full color, and black & grey, consistently impressing clients with his meticulous attention to detail and artistic prowess. His private studio is a testament to his dedication to providing a professional and focused environment for his clients' tattooing experiences.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Alejandro Korn, Buenos Aires, Argentina"
